OL,3,GNEWSADisruption until 2028 as new water
OL,4,Apipes installed
OL,5,
OL,6,FLane closures and footpath diversions
OL,7,Fwill be in place while new water pipes
OL,8,Fare installed.
OL,10,FNorthumbrian Water will begin the #4m
OL,11,Fwork across the Salters Lane area of
OL,12,FNewcastle on Monday, and said it
OL,13,Fexpected to finish it by February 2028.
OL,15,FKenton Avenue, Wilson Gardens,
OL,16,FOsbaldestone Gardens, Adeline Gardens,
OL,17,FOakhurst Drive, Eddleston Avenue, and
OL,18,FMontagu Avenue will all be impacted by
OL,19,Fthe work, which will be completed in
OL,20,Fphases.
